  '[{"id": "a", "text": "Avoiding every uncertain decision"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Waiting for others to start first"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Refusing to learn from failure"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Willingness to take calculated risks"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'Entrepreneurs accept risk after weighing it. ''Avoiding every uncertain decision'' is the opposite, because no new venture is free of uncertainty.', 2,
  'general-studies/ent211', 'q007'
