  '[{"id": "a", "text": "completing a perfect product before showing anyone"}, {"id": "b", "text": "avoiding all market research"}, {"id": "c", "text": "launching a simple version quickly and improving it using customer feedback"}, {"id": "d", "text": "delaying sales until profits are certain"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'Lean thinking tests a minimum viable product against real customers. Perfecting the product in secret delays learning and increases the cost of wrong guesses.', 4,
