  '[{"id": "a", "text": "body of the uterus"}, {"id": "b", "text": "isthmus of the uterine tube"}, {"id": "c", "text": "cervical canal"}, {"id": "d", "text": "ampulla of the uterine tube"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'The ampulla is the widest, lateral part of the tube, and the egg and sperm usually meet there. The isthmus is the narrow medial part, so it is the nearest wrong choice.', 3,
  'medicine/ant214', 'q002'
