  '[{"id": "a", "text": "subdural space, between dura and arachnoid"}, {"id": "b", "text": "epidural space outside the dura"}, {"id": "c", "text": "space between the skull and scalp"}, {"id": "d", "text": "subarachnoid space, between the arachnoid and pia mater"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'CSF fills the subarachnoid space and the ventricles. The subdural space is a potential space where bleeding collects after head injury.', 3,
  'medicine/ant315', 'q018'
