  '[{"id": "a", "text": "Chloroplast"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Golgi apparatus"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Mitochondrion"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Lysosome"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'Mitochondria carry out aerobic respiration. Chloroplasts also make ATP, but only in plant cells and as part of photosynthesis, so animal cells do not have them.', 2,
