  '[{"id": "a", "text": "Rough endoplasmic reticulum"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Golgi apparatus"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Ribosome"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Nucleolus"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'The Golgi apparatus processes and dispatches proteins in vesicles. Rough ER makes and folds proteins first, so it is the nearest wrong choice.', 3,
