  '[{"id": "a", "text": "are immune to every infection"}, {"id": "b", "text": "never pass the allele on"}, {"id": "c", "text": "are more resistant to severe malaria"}, {"id": "d", "text": "have two sickle cell genes"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'The heterozygote advantage maintains the allele in the population. Carriers have one copy only, which is why they do not suffer the full disease.', 4,
