  '[{"id": "a", "text": "a cell wall"}, {"id": "b", "text": "a nucleus"}, {"id": "c", "text": "chloroplasts"}, {"id": "d", "text": "cytoplasm"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'Onion bulb tissue grows underground and has no chloroplasts. The nucleus and wall show clearly with the stain.', 3,
