select c.id, array['Pure Mathematical']::text[], array['Mathematical Proofs']::text[], 'A drawing of a cell is 60 mm wide. The actual cell is 0.2 mm wide. The magnification of the drawing is',
  '[{"id": "a", "text": "x300"}, {"id": "b", "text": "x12"}, {"id": "c", "text": "x30"}, {"id": "d", "text": "x3,000"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'Magnification = drawing size / actual size = 60 / 0.2 = 300. The value x30 is an error of a power of ten. The value x12 multiplies the two sizes instead of dividing them, and x3,000 is a slip of a power of ten.', 4,
