  '[{"id": "a", "text": "hypertonic to the potato cells"}, {"id": "b", "text": "hypotonic to the potato cells"}, {"id": "c", "text": "pure water"}, {"id": "d", "text": "isotonic to the potato cells"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'No net water movement means the solution and the cell sap have equal water potential. In pure water, the cylinders gain mass.', 4,
