  '[{"id": "a", "text": "5.6 dm3"}, {"id": "b", "text": "11.2 dm3"}, {"id": "c", "text": "22.4 dm3"}, {"id": "d", "text": "2.8 dm3"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'Volume = 0.25 x 22.4 = 5.6 dm3. Half a mole would give 11.2 dm3, which is the nearest wrong value.', 2,
  'medicine/chem111', 'q016'
