select c.id, array['Pure Mathematical']::text[], array['Mathematical Proofs']::text[], '4.0 g of sodium hydroxide (NaOH = 40) is dissolved to make 500 cm3 of solution. The concentration is',
  '[{"id": "a", "text": "0.2 mol/dm3"}, {"id": "b", "text": "0.1 mol/dm3"}, {"id": "c", "text": "0.4 mol/dm3"}, {"id": "d", "text": "2.0 mol/dm3"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'Moles = 4 / 40 = 0.1. The volume is 0.5 dm3, so concentration = 0.1 / 0.5 = 0.2 mol/dm3. Forgetting to convert cm3 to dm3 gives other values. The value 0.1 mol/dm3 is the number of moles, not a concentration.', 3,
  'medicine/chem111', 'q017'
