select c.id, array['Logical']::text[], array['Essential / definitive']::text[], 'The unusually high boiling point of water compared with hydrogen sulphide is mainly due to',
  '[{"id": "a", "text": "stronger covalent bonds inside the water molecule"}, {"id": "b", "text": "hydrogen bonding between water molecules"}, {"id": "c", "text": "higher molar mass of water"}, {"id": "d", "text": "ionic bonding between water molecules"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'Water molecules form hydrogen bonds because oxygen is highly electronegative. Water''s molar mass is actually lower than that of H2S, so molar mass is the wrong reason.', 3,
