  '[{"id": "a", "text": "shift the equilibrium towards the reactants"}, {"id": "b", "text": "shift the equilibrium towards ammonia"}, {"id": "c", "text": "have no effect on the position of equilibrium"}, {"id": "d", "text": "change the value of the equilibrium constant"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'Higher pressure favours the side with fewer gas moles: 2 on the product side against 4 on the reactant side. The constant K changes only with temperature, so changing pressure cannot alter it.', 4,
