  '[{"id": "a", "text": "[N2][H2]^3 / [NH3]^2"}, {"id": "b", "text": "[NH3]^2 / ([N2][H2]^3)"}, {"id": "c", "text": "[NH3] / ([N2][H2])"}, {"id": "d", "text": "2[NH3] / (3[H2][N2])"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'Products over reactants, each raised to the power of its coefficient. The inverted expression has the reactants on top, which is the nearest wrong choice.', 3,
