  '[{"id": "a", "text": "increase the solubility of silver chloride"}, {"id": "b", "text": "have no effect on the solubility of silver chloride"}, {"id": "c", "text": "increase the solubility product"}, {"id": "d", "text": "reduce the solubility of silver chloride"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'Extra chloride ions (common ion effect) push the equilibrium towards solid AgCl. The solubility product depends only on temperature, so it remains the same.', 4,
  'medicine/chem122', 'q013'
