  '[{"id": "a", "text": "Methyl orange"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Phenolphthalein"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Methyl red"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Screened methyl orange"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'The equivalence point is on the basic side, where phenolphthalein changes colour. Methyl orange changes in an acidic range and would signal the end point too early.', 4,
