select c.id, array['Pragmatic']::text[], array['Essential / definitive']::text[], 'Replacement of the squamous lining of the lower oesophagus by columnar epithelium (Barrett''s oesophagus) is an example of',
  '[{"id": "a", "text": "metaplasia"}, {"id": "b", "text": "hyperplasia"}, {"id": "c", "text": "atrophy"}, {"id": "d", "text": "hypertrophy"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'Metaplasia is the replacement of one mature cell type by another, usually in response to chronic irritation, such as acid reflux. Hyperplasia is an increase in cell number, atrophy is shrinkage and hypertrophy is an increase in cell size. None changes the type of cell.', 3,
