  '[{"id": "a", "text": "has not breached the basement membrane"}, {"id": "b", "text": "always spreads to lymph nodes"}, {"id": "c", "text": "is a benign tumour"}, {"id": "d", "text": "contains no abnormal cells"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'In situ lesions are confined to the epithelium, so there is no invasion and no metastasis. Carcinoma in situ is not benign, but it has not invaded, so it has not spread. Its cells are abnormal.', 4,
