select c.id, array['Logical']::text[], array['Essential / definitive']::text[], 'The TP53 gene, often mutated in cancer, is a',
  '[{"id": "a", "text": "proto-oncogene"}, {"id": "b", "text": "housekeeping gene for metabolism only"}, {"id": "c", "text": "tumour suppressor gene"}, {"id": "d", "text": "gene for blood group antigens"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'p53 halts the cell cycle or triggers apoptosis after DNA damage. Its loss allows damaged cells to keep dividing. A proto-oncogene promotes growth and becomes an oncogene when mutated, which is the opposite behaviour to p53.', 3,
