  '[{"id": "a", "text": "a blue-black colour"}, {"id": "b", "text": "apple-green birefringence"}, {"id": "c", "text": "a brick-red colour"}, {"id": "d", "text": "no change in colour"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'Congo red binds the beta-pleated sheet structure of amyloid, and the stained deposits show apple-green birefringence. A blue-black reaction describes iodine with starch instead.', 4,
