  '[{"id": "a", "text": "A case report"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A randomised controlled trial"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A cross-sectional survey"}, {"id": "d", "text": "An expert opinion"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'Random allocation balances known and unknown confounders between groups. A case report, though useful for generating ideas, cannot show efficacy.', 3,
