select c.id, array['Pragmatic']::text[], array['Procedural / supply chain']::text[], 'A researcher selects every 10th patient from a register after choosing a random starting point. This is',
  '[{"id": "a", "text": "stratified sampling"}, {"id": "b", "text": "cluster sampling"}, {"id": "c", "text": "systematic sampling"}, {"id": "d", "text": "convenience sampling"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'A fixed interval after a random start defines systematic sampling. Stratified sampling divides the population into groups first, and then samples within each.', 3,
