  '[{"id": "a", "text": "the magnitude of the magnetic flux"}, {"id": "b", "text": "the resistance of the circuit"}, {"id": "c", "text": "the rate of change of magnetic flux linkage"}, {"id": "d", "text": "the area of the coil only"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'A steady flux induces no emf, so the rate of change is what matters. The size of the flux alone is the nearest wrong answer.', 3,
