  '[{"id": "a", "text": "5 x 10^-3 J"}, {"id": "b", "text": "5 x 10^-1 J"}, {"id": "c", "text": "1 x 10^-2 J"}, {"id": "d", "text": "1 x 10^-4 J"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'E = 1/2 C V^2 = 0.5 x 100 x 10^-6 x 100 = 5 x 10^-3 J. Forgetting the factor of one half gives the wrong value.', 4,
