select c.id, array['Logical']::text[], array['Procedural / supply chain']::text[], 'In the simple pendulum experiment, the bob should be displaced through a small angle (about 10 degrees or less) because',
  '[{"id": "a", "text": "the motion is then approximately simple harmonic"}, {"id": "b", "text": "a large angle makes the bob heavier"}, {"id": "c", "text": "a small angle reduces the length of the string"}, {"id": "d", "text": "the period depends mainly on the angle"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'The formula T = 2 pi sqrt(l/g) holds for small angles. For large angles the motion departs from simple harmonic motion.', 3,
