select c.id, array['Pure Mathematical']::text[], array['Mathematical Proofs']::text[], 'In Hooke''s law experiment, the extension is 2 cm for each 1 N added, within the elastic limit. The spring constant is',
  '[{"id": "a", "text": "0.5 N/m"}, {"id": "b", "text": "2 N/m"}, {"id": "c", "text": "5000 N/m"}, {"id": "d", "text": "50 N/m"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'k = F / x = 1 / 0.02 = 50 N/m. Using 2 cm without conversion gives 0.5 N/cm, which is not in SI units.', 3,
  'medicine/phy107', 'q002'
