select c.id, array['Pure Mathematical']::text[], array['Mathematical Proofs']::text[], 'A solid weighs 4.0 N in air and 2.5 N when fully immersed in water. Its relative density is about',
  '[{"id": "a", "text": "1.6"}, {"id": "b", "text": "0.4"}, {"id": "c", "text": "2.7"}, {"id": "d", "text": "1.5"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'Loss in weight = 1.5 N, so relative density = 4.0 / 1.5 = 2.7. Using the apparent weight as the loss gives 1.6, which is wrong.', 4,
