select c.id, array['Pragmatic']::text[], array['Essential / definitive']::text[], 'A rheostat is connected in series in a circuit in order to',
  '[{"id": "a", "text": "measure the voltage across the cell"}, {"id": "b", "text": "vary the current by changing the resistance"}, {"id": "c", "text": "store charge"}, {"id": "d", "text": "reduce the emf of the cell"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'A rheostat is a variable resistor, so it controls the current without changing the emf of the cell. Measuring voltage needs a voltmeter and storing charge needs a capacitor.', 2,
