select c.id, array['Canon / Administrative']::text[], array['Essential / definitive']::text[], 'The vitamin K-dependent clotting factors are',
  '[{"id": "a", "text": "I, V, VIII and XI"}, {"id": "b", "text": "III, IV, VI and XII"}, {"id": "c", "text": "VIII, IX, XI and XIII"}, {"id": "d", "text": "II, VII, IX and X"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'Vitamin K is needed to carboxylate these factors in the liver. Factor VIII is not vitamin K-dependent, so haemophilia A is not corrected by vitamin K.', 4,
